OL,3,GNEWSAPatrols to start in places visited
OL,4,Aby asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrols by private security guards are
OL,7,Fto begin from Monday at three Essex
OL,8,Flocations that asylum seekers
OL,9,Ffrequently visit, a council has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FSix trained and uniformed "security
OL,13,Foperatives" would patrol Braintree,
OL,14,FColchester and Chelmsford centres seven
OL,15,Fdays a week, from 10:00 to 18:00, as
OL,16,Fpart of a three-month trial, said
OL,17,FReform UK-led Essex County Council.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
